  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peusangan Conservation Project: Building A New Hope for The Giant of Sumatra</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure the long-term survival of Sumatran elephant populations by conserving critical habitats and reducing human-elephant conflict, promote biodiversity conservation through sustainable agricultural practices (coffee, cacao) and to develop a sustainable conservation financing strategy including through carbon project development.</narrative>
  </description>
